# GitHub's auto-generated "Source code (zip)/(tar.gz)" release archives are built
# with `git archive` and honor export-ignore. This repo only publishes release
# downloads (smactu.vsix) — it is not the extension's source — so exclude
# everything from those archives and leave only a short pointer file, to avoid
# misleading anyone who downloads them. (The download links themselves cannot be
# removed, and this affects only tags created after this commit.)
* export-ignore
/SOURCE-ARCHIVE-NOTICE.txt -export-ignore
